diff --git a/changelog/7168.bugfix.rst b/changelog/7168.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4172662
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/7168.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fixed internal error when the ``__repr__`` of a test outcome's value raised an
+exception whose object also raised on attribute access (for example a failing
+``__getattribute__``), by no longer accessing ``__class__`` on the object being
+repr'd.
